---
import { siteConfig, whatsappLink } from '@/lib/site-config'
---

<section id="contato" class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 md:py-28" aria-labelledby="contato-heading">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-dot-grid pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6">
    <div class="reveal relative rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-card p-8 md:p-12 max-w-2xl">
      <h2 id="contato-heading" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">
        Vamos tirar sua ideia do papel?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Precisa de um site, quer automatizar um processo ou melhorar uma solução existente?
        Me conta o que você tem em mente e vamos conversar sobre o melhor caminho.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-foreground mt-0.5 shrink-0"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium">WhatsApp</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1">
              {siteConfig.whatsapp}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-foreground mt-0.5 shrink-0"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect>
            <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium">E-mail</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1">
              <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground">{siteConfig.email}</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a
        href={whatsappLink('contact')}
        class="cta-ring mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-md bg-highlight text-highlight-foreground font-semibold text-sm hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform"
      >
        Conversar no WhatsApp 💬
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
